Subject: [PATCH] simple: report terminal focus scan diagnostics on demand

Enable with LIBCAMERA_LOG_LEVELS='*:FATAL,V4L2:ERROR,Y700Af:DEBUG'.
The opt-in AF_DIAG row reports a terminal phase and reason. Its three
counter columns are coarse/fine/verify. Controls count successful
CameraLens calls. Lens API status may normalize the driver errno. The
existing V4L2 error log carries the original ioctl error text. Neither
control success nor the status poll measures mechanical lens travel.

The row contains no images, image measurements, positions or calibration
values. It does not change the decision or capture sequence. The pipeline
owns the diagnostic counters, preserving the older ContrastScan ABI.
Apply after simple-focus.patch and installation of contrast_scan.{cpp,h}.
---

